<title>USA: Owens-Illinois says sells its Kimble stake.</title>
<headline>Owens-Illinois says sells its Kimble stake.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owens-Illinois Inc said Monday under the terms of a joint venture agreement, Gerresheimer Glas AG of Germany has exercised its rights to purchase Owens-Illinois' 49 percent interest in Kimble Glass Inc.</p>
<p>As a result, Kimble Glass is now a wholly owned subsidiary of Gerresheimer Glas.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Kimble Glass Inc joint venture was formed in December 1993, with Gerresheimer Glas having a 51 percent interest and Owens-Illinois having 49 percent.</p>
</text>
